msgstr "https://github.com/drilonsaiti/dealer-inventory-for-autoscout24"

#. Description of the plugin
#: dealer-inventory-for-autoscout24.php
msgid ""
"Show a car dealer's AutoScout24 stock on their own WordPress site: synced "
"locally, fast, crawlable and fully styleable."
msgstr ""
"Zeigt den AutoScout24-Fahrzeugbestand eines Autohändlers auf der eigenen "
"WordPress-Website: lokal synchronisiert, schnell, für Suchmaschinen lesbar "
"und frei gestaltbar."

#. Author of the plugin
#: dealer-inventory-for-autoscout24.php
msgid "Drilon Saiti"
msgstr "Drilon Saiti"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: dealer-inventory-for-autoscout24.php
msgid "https://drilonsaiti.github.io/"
msgstr "https://drilonsaiti.github.io/"

#: includes/class-admin.php:58
msgid ""
"Our vehicle listings are provided by AutoScout24 (SMG Swiss Marketplace "
"Group AG). Vehicle photos are loaded directly from the AutoScout24 image "
"server (images.autoscout24.ch); your browser therefore sends your IP address"
" and browser information to that server. Links to vehicles lead to "
"autoscout24.ch."
msgstr ""
"Unsere Fahrzeuginserate stammen von AutoScout24 (SMG Swiss Marketplace Group"
" AG). Fahrzeugfotos werden direkt vom Bildserver von AutoScout24 "
"(images.autoscout24.ch) geladen; Ihr Browser übermittelt dabei Ihre IP-"
"Adresse und Browserinformationen an diesen Server. Links zu Fahrzeugen "
"führen zu autoscout24.ch."

